The Code Mode tool catalog has changed.

New tools are available in addition to those previously listed:
  - tools.aios.approve({
  tool_name: string,
  input: unknown,
  tool_use_id?: string,
  permission_suggestions?: unknown,
}): Promise<unknown> // aios approval inbox: routes the permission request to the user.
  - tools.aios.ping({
  n?: number,
}): Promise<unknown> // aios liveness probe.
